# "Artifacts and creatures your opponents control enter tapped": Bot1's own Ornithopter enters untapped; Bot2's Mox Jet and
# Ornithopter enter tapped (seen on turn 3). Its Mind Stone, cast on turn 4, enters tapped and cannot be tapped for mana
# that turn (refusal), but can on turn 6 (positive control). When Bot2's Bolt kills Spider-Woman on turn 4, the second Ornithopter
# enters untapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Jet
Spider-Woman, Stunning Savior
Ornithopter
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mountain
Mox Jet
Mind Stone
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Spider-Woman, Stunning Savior.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = false
? Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Tapped = true
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain#1.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Mind Stone.Cast
Bot2.Pass
! Bot2.Battlefield.Mind Stone.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain#2.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Spider-Woman, Stunning Savior)
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T6 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Battlefield.Mind Stone.Activate(Ability: Add)

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#2.Tapped = false
Bot1.Graveyard = Spider-Woman, Stunning Savior
Bot2.Battlefield.Mind Stone.Tapped = true
